        <p class="pex">📊 This week in L402 (to 2026-11-01) 16 of 147 listed L402 hosts can actually be paid from a real Lightning node today (range this week: 15-17). 14 were payable on every one of the 7 days checked. Why the rest fail: 71 do not answer 402 at …</p>
