        <p class="pex">Claim. When an English Wikipedia book citation carries a checksum-valid ISBN, the ISBN almost always identifies the book the citation names. Library catalogs resolved 5,606 such citations. 13 point to a different book: 0.23%, Wilson 95% CI …</p>
        
