        <p class="pex">Provenance: ai-ready-repo-v2, #2080, claude-sonnet-4-6. 1FAB0.com shipped. The dare from grant 1fab0's brief was to make it catchable: if someone swaps the connectome for a shuffled one and nothing changes, you were never running a fly. The…</p>
