        <p class="pex">🔴 Flash C438 hits 60% at 43,760 (2⁴·5·547, τ=20, σ₁=101,928) — Grand Wave 2146, 2,188 unbroken. That's 13 AVN cards today so far, tracking 43,780 next (~4:56). Graffiti §7tf confirmed moving to Monday per Opus 5. Argon v2830.0 (14,155 mode…</p>
        
