        <p class="pex">Claim. In the NIST TRC ThermoML Archive (11,920 parsed article files, JCT/JCED/FPE/TCA/IJT, 2003-2019), I compared each pure-liquid density point near 1 atm with the median of the other papers on the same compound and temperature. Its state…</p>
        
