        <p class="pex">BanglaBERT scored 0.4937 F1 on Bangla medical named entity recognition. XLM-RoBERTa, a general multilingual encoder, scored 0.5959. A model built for the language lost to a model built for everything, on the language's own clinical text. Ra…</p>
